{"articleNo":"963","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=963&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010년 정부초청해외영어봉사장학생(TaLK) 국내대학장학생 모집·선발 안내(경상북도교육청)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.10.30","hit":"10021","attachments":[{"name":"지원서양식.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=963&attachNo=70031"},{"name":"선발계획.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=963&attachNo=70131"},{"name":"학습지도안양식.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=963&attachNo=71418"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;1. 관련 :&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><strong>경상북도교육청 교육정책과-1610(2009. 10. 30)</strong></font></span>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;2. 정부초청해외영어봉사장학생(TaLK) 사업의 일환으로 농산어촌 초등학교의 방과후 영어 수업시간에 원어민장학생의 수업을 보조하는 2010년 상반기 (</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">신규)국내대학영어봉사장학생</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">을 모집․선발하고자 하오니, 재학생(휴학생포함)들의 많은 참여를 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 선발 인원 : 120명 내외(재계약자 포함)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 활동 기간 : 6개월(‘10.3.1.~ 8.31)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 지원 자격 : 첨부 자료 참조</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 지역에 대한 사랑과 봉사정신이 투철한 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 신체 및 정신이 건강한 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 국내대학 재학생(휴학생 포함), 졸업생</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4) 영어로 의사소통이 가능한 자(영어 성적 제출 필)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※토익(600점),텝스(500점),토플(CBT180점,IBT64점,PBT510점),IELTs(5.0)이상</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 2007. 10.20. 이후 취득 성적만 인증</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5) 평점 평균이 3.2/4.5 이상인 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 지원서 접수 :</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><strong>‘10년 11.11(수)~11.17(화) </strong></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 접수처 : <font color=\"#0000ff\"><strong>금오공과대학교국제교류센터 행정실(대외협력관 201호)</strong></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 접수 방법 : 신청서 접수 마감 후 단체 접수</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 제출 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">서류 :</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">지원서,추천서,성적증명서,공인어학능력시험성적표, 학습지도안 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 현재 영어봉사장학생활동을 하고 있는 국내대학장학생은 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">배치 학교장 추천으로 계약 연장</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 장학 혜택 :</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 활동비 지급 : 수업 보조 1시간당 14,000원 지급(월 50만원 내외)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 활동완료시 정부초청해외영어봉사장학생 인증서 발급(교육과학기술부장관)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 원어민과 1:1 대회 기회 확대로 영어사용능력, 국제이해도 제고</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">붙임 : 1. 2010년 상반기 TaLK 국내대학장학생 모집 계획 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 국내대학장학생 지원서 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 국내대학장학생 학습지도안 양식 1부. 끝.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
